  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3776,
      "text": "Do they not see that We have created for them livestock made by Our Hands, and then they are their owners?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3777,
      "text": "And We have made them subservient to them; some they ride, and from others they eat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3778,
      "text": "and there are other benefits and drinks therein for them. Will they not then give thanks?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3779,
      "text": "Yet they have taken other gods besides Allah, hoping that they may be helped.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3780,
      "text": "They cannot help them, yet they serve them as their dedicated guards[21].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3781,
      "text": "Do not let their words grieve you. Surely We know what they conceal and what they reveal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3782,
      "text": "Does man not see that We have created him from a sperm-drop, then[22] he becomes a clear adversary,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3783,
      "text": "producing arguments[23] against Us while forgetting his own creation[24]. He says, “Who can give life to the bones after they have crumbled to dust?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3784,
      "text": "Say, “The One Who created them in the first place will give life to them, for He has full knowledge of every created being;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3785,
      "text": "the One Who made for you fire out of the green tree, with which you kindle your fires[25].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3786,
      "text": "Is not the One Who created the heavens and earth able to create the like of these [people]? Yes indeed, for He is the Creator of all, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3787,
      "text": "Whenever He wills something to be, He only says to it, “Be”, and it is.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 445,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3788,
      "text": "So glory be to the One in Whose Hand is the dominion of everything, and to Him you will all be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
